{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a67f8f5bcbe197f52f0b149ab4513998f2687f68ab99992a738cfc5a33b19c3a", "ja": "（映画『近未来アウトサイダー』の配役が発表された。\n今は、それぞれ台本を読み込んでいるところだが……）", "zh": "（电影《近未来局外人》的演员阵容公布了。\n现在，大家正在研读各自的剧本……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "1963637e51dc68874a6561eae71f513602850138021e98270aeed60866acd485", "ja": "はいはーい！　ハニー！\nミキ、質問があるの！", "zh": "好——！亲爱的！\n美希有问题要问！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d5b7011fa34a53aed4365025393a40f41dd85b2fdece26b06aaedda30d66c707", "ja": "お、いつになく気合いが入ってるな。\nよし、答えられることならなんでも聞いてくれ！", "zh": "哦，今天格外有干劲嘛。\n好啊，只要是我能回答的，你尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "33a3d1050215680602ea6895e08f2eb6aec8e5f9fef83f56396f27026578afba", "ja": "あのね、ミキ、台本読んでて思ったんだけど……。\nバスターブレイドって、お風呂はどうしてるのかな？", "zh": "那个啊，美希看剧本的时候就在想……\n破坏之刃平时是怎么洗澡的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "032deb29d5c8f4b9a7488d9985df88881f9f76b0489bb3c7c2bc65b936bc1eee", "ja": "えっ！　お風呂か……。\nうーん、どうしてるのかな。", "zh": "诶！洗澡啊……  \n嗯——会怎么洗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "70995ef9f3a10a2b6870667b5d8bd049d383588666a0c155019a8e95446968c9", "ja": "そもそも、あの世界は水が貴重だろうから……\nずっと入ってないとか？", "zh": "说到底，那个世界的水很珍贵吧……\n该不会一直都没洗澡？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "c9ddef12d2b2fbee6ebb312929fe9841cfb0a939f640faa05a6ebf48d3dc7fc3", "ja": "え～～～！？　そんなの、ありえないの！\nバスターブレイド、ヤじゃないのかな？", "zh": "诶～～～！？怎么可能嘛！\nBuster Blade难道不会讨厌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1007_p", "source_sha256": "359a74a3824fcdc979c31a8384e638baa2c20e9398227f7a92e4bb69ac4e736a", "ja": "ヤだと思うけど、なにしろ文明が滅びた後だし。\nもう慣れるしかないんじゃないか？", "zh": "我觉得它应该会讨厌吧，毕竟那可是文明毁灭之后啊。也只能慢慢习惯了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "1e39edcb4876c0ce2ea0097efd76e756e359e934b2e69fa3e492c5b89eea657a", "ja": "むー。じゃあ、きっとシャンプーとかもないよね。\nネイルもリップも～、いちごババロアも、オニギリも。", "zh": "唔——那洗发水之类的肯定也没有吧。\n美甲、唇膏～，还有草莓芭伐洛亚和饭团。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "65f7631bcd4809bd77b224c372fbeed15e5517dafa8f5ba7d746c4cd61a30a2b", "ja": "オニギリはもしかしたら……。\nでも、他はないだろうな。", "zh": "饭团说不定还有……  \n不过，其他的应该都没有吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "86d742e7399fa3b80de1941f5a5c73b521cfe2bec54623d70c424e450f25d0e8", "ja": "バスターブレイド、かわいそうなの……。\nミキだったら、絶対ガマンできないってカンジ。", "zh": "Buster Blade，好可怜哦……  \n要是美希的话，感觉绝对忍受不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "0b2389725300f256e8a79d3f3ec8e4f70ca81f7015ca71be9636221fee3b221e", "ja": "ハニー、もしミキが本物のバスターブレイドになって、\n映画の世界に行っちゃったら、すぐに迎えに来てね？", "zh": "亲爱的，要是美希变成真正的巴斯特·布雷德，跑到电影的世界里去了，你要马上来接我哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d206a277631b20f4fb89f353b33e39d9c57ed7d46c60932e34318ebedec80a36", "ja": "……いいけど、それだと、あの世界のダスクが\n心配じゃないか？　ファイナルデイとかも。", "zh": "……可以是可以，不过这样的话，你不担心那个世界的达斯克吗？还有最终日什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "6dafdcddf5538adff43e7e83eaccfa4b1a767264d6878a40604274e030968bde", "ja": "春香と千早さんなら、\n二人でどうにかするって思うな。", "zh": "春香和千早的话，\n我觉得她们两个人会想办法解决的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "08f81641dacda1335ab58fdd7a50c88d16dcd17135ecdc01e8f1ef03bb0385b4", "ja": "いや、そうなんだけど。\n二人とも春香と千早本人じゃないからなぁ。", "zh": "话是这么说啦。\n但毕竟你们俩又不是春香和千早本人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b67ac36e25b154550a6ba513d9be950d81b92d2b91cc6a48e9fa0c5cef36a6c", "ja": "うーん……。でも、やっぱり平気なの！\nだって、もしそうなったらー。", "zh": "嗯……不过，果然还是没关系的！\n因为，要是真变成那样的话——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "946f6115b912ad6b0d1b9e1acf9eec4df69b93e0d3446d4625a0a2288181c166", "ja": "ハニー、ミキ達みんなを連れて帰るに決まってるもん。\nだからミキ、ハニーをお昼寝して待ってるね☆", "zh": "亲爱的，肯定会把我们大家都带回去的嘛。\n所以美希会睡个午觉等着你哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ae010ac830a539e269b17bb9ec7d518b5fde9ecde6697aa6c4a894067b2ee0d8", "ja": "（信頼にあふれた、安らかな笑顔。\nなるほど、これが平和の秘密……かもしれないな！）", "zh": "（充满信赖的安详笑容。原来如此，这就是和平的秘密……也许吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
